WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.367
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.834
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:05.501
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:07.734
Government regulators
on Friday

00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:09.801
seized control
of Silicon Valley Bank,

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:12.133
the country's 16th largest bank,

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:16.167
after it quickly became
the 178th largest bank.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:18.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.234 --> 00:00:20.133
That's right,
government regulators on Friday

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:22.000
seized control
of Silicon Valley Bank,

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.234
making it the largest
U.S. bank failure since 2008.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.501
And come to think of it,

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:29.901
it was always a bad sign
that their ATM had a tip screen.

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:33.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.767
President Biden spoke
this morning

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.167
about Friday's collapse
of Silicon Valley Bank

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:38.200
and reassured Americans

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.200
the country's financial system
is safe.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.501
But remember, this is a guy
whose whole financial system

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:46.234
is definitely a coffee can
on a high shelf.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:51.100
"See, the thing is, they never
look up there."

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.234
That's right. President Biden
reassured Americans

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:54.968
the country's
financial system is safe.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:56.400
Okay, I think the fact

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.601
that you're talking
about a bank collapse

00:00:58.601 --> 00:00:59.601
proves it isn't.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.901
That's like going to a funeral

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:05.033
and giving a eulogy about
how Nana's going to be fine.

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:07.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.400
The Oscars were held
last night,

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.501
and the film "Everything
Everywhere All At Once"

00:01:12.501 --> 00:01:14.801
won seven awards,
including Best Picture.

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:17.767
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:01:17.767 --> 00:01:19.667
Best Picture, Best Actress,

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:22.467
and worst butchering
in a text from your mom.

00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:24.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.167 --> 00:01:29.200
That's right. "Everything
Everywhere All At Once"

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.501
won best picture at last
night's Academy Awards.

00:01:31.501 --> 00:01:34.767
As for who lost -- whoever sat
behind this lady.

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:36.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.334
"Oh, my goodness.

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:42.033
My first Oscars.
My first Oscars."

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:44.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:48.300
When asked last week
about allegations

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.267
that he participated
in a credit-card skimming scam,

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:52.901
New York Congressman
George Santos said

00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:56.133
he was innocent and added,
"I'm no mastermind of anything,"

00:01:56.133 --> 00:02:00.100
which is maybe the first
believable thing he's ever said.

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:01.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:05.267
Elon Musk is reportedly
planning to build a town

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:09.067
outside Austin, Texas, for his
Tesla and SpaceX employees

00:02:09.067 --> 00:02:11.968
that he has described
in meetings as a utopia.

00:02:11.968 --> 00:02:13.000
I don't know.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.467
Have you ever been to a party

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:17.067
where one guy has a Tesla?

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:19.601
Now imagine every guy
has a Tesla.

00:02:19.601 --> 00:02:21.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:22.400
A tattoo artist in India

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.000
recently set
a Guinness world record

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.334
after spending
over 90 consecutive hours

00:02:26.334 --> 00:02:28.300
giving tattoos to 64 people

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.934
and hepatitis to 63 people.

00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:32.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:39.000
Today was National K9
Veterans Day.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.534
It's like regular Veterans Day,
except no fireworks.

00:02:42.534 --> 00:02:44.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.534 --> 00:02:50.000
We have a writer, Mike Scollins,

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:53.934
who's obsessed with the idea
that dogs don't like fireworks.

00:02:53.934 --> 00:02:57.734
A lot of his jokes are dependent
upon people knowing that.

00:02:57.734 --> 00:02:58.901
And caring.

00:03:00.634 --> 00:03:02.667
And finally, according to
a new study,

00:03:02.667 --> 00:03:06.100
reusable water bottles
can have 14 times more bacteria

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:07.133
than a pet's water bowl,

00:03:07.133 --> 00:03:09.334
but only because your cat drinks
out of it

00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:10.901
every time you turn your back.

00:03:10.901 --> 00:03:12.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:13.801
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

